Z||000001||theogre||04-06-99||06:53 PM||||do they have one for the 4's or just the v6? (ads chip)<p>If they are telling you to pull the starter so you can use a fly wheel holder to keep the crank from turning..... just try taking the crank bolt off first. Sometimes they come right off, sometimes they don't. (I can't think of any other reason they tell you that.) Odd's are you'll need to hold the flywheel tho.<p>((I'll hope you know to NEVER EVER put a strap wrench around a balancer.))
